19	
20	## Overview
21	
22	This MCP server provides complete QuickBooks Online API integration for Claude Code and other MCP-compatible clients. It includes full CRUD operations for 29 entity types and 11 financial reports, giving you comprehensive access to QuickBooks Online functionality.
23	
24	### Key Features
25	
26	- **144 Total Tools** - Complete coverage of QuickBooks Online API
27	- **29 Entity Types** - Full CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete, Search)
28	- **11 Financial Reports** - Balance Sheet, P&L, Cash Flow, and more
29	- **OAuth 2.0 Authentication** - Secure token-based authentication
30	- **TypeScript** - Full type safety with Zod validation
31	- **Tested** - Jest test suite with ESM support
32	
33	---
34	
35	## Quick Start
36	
37	### Installation
38	
39	```bash
40	# Clone the repository
41	git clone https://github.com/your-username/mcp-quickbooks-online.git
42	cd mcp-quickbooks-online
43	
44	# Install dependencies
45	npm install
46	
47	# Build the project
48	npm run build
49	```
50	
51	### Configuration
52	
53	Copy the template `.env.example` to `.env` in the root directory and fill in your values:
54	
55	```bash
56	cp .env.example .env
57	```
58	
59	```env
60	QUICKBOOKS_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id
61	QUICKBOOKS_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret
62	QUICKBOOKS_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox
63	QUICKBOOKS_REFRESH_TOKEN=your_refresh_token
64	QUICKBOOKS_REALM_ID=your_realm_id
65	```
66	
67	`.env` is gitignored so your real credentials stay local.
68	
69	### Claude Code Integration
70	
71	Add to your Claude Code MCP configuration:
72	
73	```json
74	{
75	  "mcpServers": {
76	    "quickbooks": {
77	      "command": "node",
78	      "args": ["path/to/mcp-quickbooks-online/dist/index.js"],
79	      "env": {
80	        "QUICKBOOKS_CLIENT_ID": "your_client_id",
81	        "QUICKBOOKS_CLIENT_SECRET": "your_client_secret",
82	        "QUICKBOOKS_REFRESH_TOKEN": "your_refresh_token",
83	        "QUICKBOOKS_REALM_ID": "your_realm_id",
84	        "QUICKBOOKS_ENVIRONMENT": "sandbox"
85	      }
86	    }
87	  }
88	}
89	```
